,"url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetrylock-与更新顺序","content":"更新 `pyproject.toml`。"},"576":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-27","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetrylock-与更新顺序","content":"依照 `pyproject.toml` 的内容，更新 `poetry.lock` 。"},"577":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-28","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetrylock-与更新顺序","content":"依照 `poetry.lock` 的内容，更新虚拟环境。"},"578":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-29","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetrylock-与更新顺序","content":"由此可见， `poetry.lock` 的内容是取决于 `pyproject.toml` ，但两者并不会自己连动，一定要基于特定指令才会进行同步与更新， `poetry add` 就是一个典型案例。"},"579":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-30","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-lock-更新-poetrylock","content":"当你自行修改了 `pyproject.toml` 内容，比如变更特定模块的版本（这是有可能的，尤其在手动处理版本冲突的时候），此时 `poetry.lock` 的内容与 `pyproject.toml` 出现了脱钩，必须让它依照新的 `pyproject.toml` 内容更新、同步，使用指令："},"580":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-31","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-lock-更新-poetrylock","content":"如此一来，才能确保手动修改的内容，也更新到 `poetry.lock` 中，毕竟虚拟环境如果要重新建立，是基于 `poetry.lock` 的内容来安装模块，而非 `pyproject.toml` 。\n还是那句话："},"581":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-32","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-lock-更新-poetrylock","content":"> poetry.lock 相当于 Poetry 的 requirements.txt。"},"582":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-33","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-lock-更新-poetrylock","content":"但要特别注意的是， `poetry lock` 指令，仅会更新 `poetry.lock` ，不会同时安装模块至虚拟环境\n因此，在执行完 `poetry lock` 指令后，必须再使用 `poetry install` 来安装模块。否则就会出现 `poetry.lock` 和虚拟环境不一致的状况。\n更多 `poetry lock` 细节可参考 官方文件，其中特别值得注意的是 `--no-update` 参数。"},"583":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-34","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#新增模块至-dev-dependencies","content":"有些模块，比如 pytest 、 black 等等，只会在开发环境中使用，产品的部署环境并不需要。\nPoetry 允许你区分这两者，将上述的模块安装至 dev-dependencies 区块，便于建立一份「不包含」 dev-dependencies 开发模块的安装清单。\n在此以 Black 为例，安装方式如下："},"584":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-35","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#新增模块至-dev-dependencies","content":"结果的区别显示在 pyproject.toml 里："},"585":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-36","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#新增模块至-dev-dependencies","content":"可以看到 black 被列在不同区块： `tool.poetry.dev-dependencies` 。\n&#x2A;*强烈建议善用 `dev-dependencies`**\n善用 `--group dev` 参数，明确区分开发环境，我认为非常必要。\n首先，这些模块常常属于「检测型」工具，相关的依赖模块着实不少！比如 flake8 ，它依赖了 `pycodestyle` 、 `pyflakes` 、 `mccabe` 等等，还有 `black` 、 `pre-commit` ，依赖模块数量也都很可观。"},"586":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-37","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-更新模块","content":"这个就很简单了，使用 poetry update 指令即可："},"587":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-38","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-更新模块","content":"上面指令会更新全部可能可以更新的模块，也可以仅指定特定模块，比如："},"588":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-39","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#poetry-更新模块","content":"关于 `poetry update` 的其余参数，请参考文件。\n还一件重要的事，那就是关于模块版本的升级限制规则，取决于你在 pyproject.toml 中的设定。"},"589":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-40","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#列出全部模块清单","content":"树状显示依赖层"},"590":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-41","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#列出全部模块清单","content":"**也可以指定模块显示**"},"591":{"id":"/docs/backend/poetry-42","page_id":"/docs/backend/poetry","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/backend/poetry#导出poetry-虚拟环境requirementstxt","content":"导出dev的包"},"592":{"id":"/docs/backend/shell","page_id":"/docs/backend/shell","type":"page","content":"Shell","breadcrumbs":["