#登录系统","content":"首次登录后建议立即修改管理员密码。生产环境还应尽早完成 HTTPS、备份、组织、角色和权限配置。"},"897":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-35","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#登录系统","content":"登录后如果页面提示账号或密码错误，请回到安装输出确认初始密码。不要尝试猜测默认密码，公开环境也不应长期保留初始密码。"},"898":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-36","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#登录系统","content":"v1.5.6 起统一使用登录入口。普通用户登录后通常进入数据门户，查看已授权的已发布仪表盘和数据大屏；具备后台权限的管理员或编辑人员，可以从门户入口或账号菜单进入后台工作台。"},"899":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"数据门户用于普通用户查看已发布资源，适合只读访问、部门看板、项目验收和日常经营查看。"},"900":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"门户中常见区域包括："},"901":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"区域"},"902":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"用途"},"903":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"我的收藏"},"904":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"固定高频查看的仪表盘和数据大屏"},"905":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"最近使用"},"906":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"回到最近打开的资源"},"907":{"id":"/docs/crest/quick-start-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/quick-start#认识数据门户","content":"全部资源"},"908