开启之后会依次去完成以下的工作","content":"关机时，给所有由launchd开启的进程发送SIGTERM信号。\n我们将log信息中的内容与`/System/Library/LaunchDaemons`路径下的plist进行对照，发现在系统开启之初的bootlog，blued，mDNSResponder等都能再该路径下找到。"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-boot-10","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"> 在launchd依次完成的工作中，可以看到它是先注册套接字和文件描述符，然后才去启动进程，因此plist指定的进程的启动先后顺序并不明确。"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-boot-11","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"launchd配置文件总共有五个路径，在系统开启之初，只加载了`/System/Library/LaunchDaemons` 和`/Library/LaunchDaemons`路径下的plist文件，另外三个路径下的plist文件是在用户login之后才进行的。"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-boot-12","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"用户的login是由loginwindow进程完成的，而loginwindow的启动又是由`/System/Library/LaunchDaemons`路径下的com.apple.loginwindow\\.plist指定的。"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-boot-13","page_id":"/docs/network/macos-boot","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos-boot#launchdaemons路径下的plist指定的进程启动是否存在一定的先后顺序呢","content":"用户登录之后，launchd才会去加载`/System/Library/LaunchAgents` 和`/Library/LaunchAgents`以及`~/Library/LaunchAgents`路径下的plist文件，从而根据plist文件的具体设置去启动相应的进程。"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/network/macos","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"page","content":"macOS","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","网络与工具"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-0","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/network/macos","content":"开发环境和系统设置。"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-1","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos#minikube","content":"minikube"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/network/macos-2","page_id":"/docs/network/macos","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/network/macos#macos工具集","co