/crest/deployment/kubernetes","content":"Crest 提供 Kustomize 清单，适合部署到 Kubernetes 集群。v1.5.10 的集群部署采用前后端分离结构：`crest` 是前端 Nginx 网关，`crest-service` 是后端 Spring Boot 服务，元数据库可选择内置 MySQL 或外部 MySQL。需要运行监控时，可启用 Prometheus 和 Grafana overlay。"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","content":"Kubernetes 部署更适合已有集群和运维体系的团队。部署重点在于将命名空间、Secret、PVC、Service、Ingress、数据库、日志、备份和监控纳入统一管理。首次验证可以使用内置 MySQL，生产环境建议优先评估外部 MySQL。"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","content":"集群部署完成后，应通过页面完成业务验证，而不能只依赖 Pod 状态判断。下面的工作台截图可作为第一轮页面验收参考：能登录、能加载菜单、能显示资源统计，说明前端网关、后端服务和元数据库已基本连通。"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#目录结构","content":"`base` 放应用公共配置，包含前端和后端两个 Deployment、两个 Service、PVC、ServiceAccount、后端配置和 Nginx 配置。`internal-mysql` 额外部署 MySQL StatefulSet；`external-mysql` 只部署 Crest，并通过 Secret 连接外部数据库。带 `observability` 后缀的 overlay 会额外部署 Prometheus、Grafana 和相关访问控制。"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"默认应用镜像："},"2459":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-24","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"默认服务："},"2460":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-25","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"服务"},"2461":{"id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes-26","page_id":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/deployment/kubernetes#镜像与服务","content":"作用"},"2462":{"id":"/docs/crest/d