端时，可以复用发布的前端镜像或已有前端环境；仅改前端时，可以复用发布的后端镜像或内网后端服务。"},"3161":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","content":"Crest 本身需要一个 MySQL 元数据库，用来保存用户、权限、数据源配置、数据集、图表、仪表盘和大屏。你在页面里新建的“数据源”是业务数据源，可能是 MySQL、Oracle、OceanBase、Excel 或 API。开发环境里最先要准备的是 Crest 元数据库，不是业务数据源。"},"3162":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","content":"前端开发只需要能访问一个可用后端；后端开发只需要能连接 Crest 元数据库。只有验证镜像、安装包、网关转发或发布流程时，才需要同时构建前端和后端。"},"3163":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#最常用的开发流程","content":"如团队已提供 `v1.5.10` 开发库 dump，建议按以下流程搭建："},"3164":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#拉代码","content":"克隆 Crest，切到 `v1.5.10`，再从 tag 建自己的开发分支。"},"3165":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#导入元数据库","content":"新建本地 `crest` 库，把团队提供的 `v1.5.10` dump 导进去。"},"3166":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#写本地环境变量","content":"新建 `.local/crest-dev-env.sh`。数据库地址、账号、密码、加密密钥、文件目录都写在这里，不改仓库里的 `application*.yml`。"},"3167":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-47","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup#关闭本地不需要的功能","content":"导入完整 dump 后关闭 Flyway；本地不调 SSO 时关闭 SSO；业务数据源连不到时改成内网可访问地址。"},"3168":{"id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup-48","page_id":"/docs/crest/development/local-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/devel