ualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#导出失败","content":"字体不一致"},"3503":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-83","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#导出失败","content":"检查字体管理和导出环境"},"3504":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-84","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"v1.5.5 起，数据大屏支持通过导出按钮绑定表格视图并提交 Excel 导出任务。按钮不可用时，按以下顺序排查："},"3505":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-85","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"导出按钮是否已经绑定目标表格。"},"3506":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-86","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"目标表格是否有数据。"},"3507":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-87","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"当前账号是否有导出权限。"},"3508":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-88","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"导出范围是否选择了当前筛选结果或全部数据。"},"3509":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-89","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"页面查询组件、联动、外部参数是否导致结果为空。"},"3510":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-90","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"导出中心是否生成任务，任务是否失败。"},"3511":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-91","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#大屏导出按钮不可用","content":"如果导出任务被取消或后端返回错误，v1.5.6 会给出更明确的失败反馈。仍无法定位时，保留导出时间、资源名称、筛选条件和导出中心状态，交给管理员查看应用日志。"},"3512":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-92","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"v1.5.6 起，明细表可以在开启“合并单元格”后选择合并字段。合并只针对上下相邻且值相同的单元格；选择后置维度时，会在前置维度相同的范围内合并。"},"3513":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-93","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"常见问题："},"3514":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-94","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"现象"},"3515":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-95","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"处理"},"3516":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-96","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"不想合并任何列"},"3517":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-97","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"清空“合并字段”"},"3518":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-98","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"同名项目被跨部门合并"},"3519":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-99","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"同时选择部门和项目，确保项目在部门范围内合并"},"3520":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-100","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"指标列不能选择"},"3521":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-101","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"正常，指标字段不参与合并"},"3522":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-102","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"历史表格升级后表现不同"},"3523":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-103","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#明细表合并效果不符合预期","content":"检查是否保存过新的合并字段配置；未保存时会沿用历史默认规则"},"3524":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-104","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"入口：数据血缘。"},"3525":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-105","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"数据血缘适合回答："},"3526":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-106","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"某个图表字段来自哪个数据集字段。"},"3527":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-107","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"数据集字段来自哪个数据源表字段。"},"3528":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-108","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"修改某个数据源字段会影响哪些图表。"},"3529":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-109","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"删除数据集前会影响哪些仪表盘或大屏。"},"3530":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-110","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#如何确认字段来源","content":"排查字段问题时，建议先查看血缘，再决定是否修改数据源、数据集或图表。"},"3531":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-111","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"当前版本中，MySQL 数据源数据集支持缓存读取。数据集开启缓存后，图表读取的可能不是数据源实时结果。遇到“数据库里已经更新，但页面还是旧数据”的问题，按以下顺序确认："},"3532":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-112","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"打开数据集，查看是否启用了缓存。"},"3533":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-113","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"查看缓存同步时间和同步状态。"},"3534":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-114","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"查看源数据行数、缓存行数和一致性校验结果。"},"3535":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-115","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"手动触发一次同步或等待定时任务执行。"},"3536":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-116","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"回到图表、仪表盘或数据大屏刷新页面。"},"3537":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-117","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"如果仍是旧数据，再检查 SQL、过滤条件、增量字段和数据权限。"},"3538":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-118","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"缓存适合提升查询性能，但需要和业务方说明刷新周期。实时监控类页面不建议使用过长缓存周期。"},"3539":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-119","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"常见状态处理："},"3540":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-120","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"状态"},"3541":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-121","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"处理"},"3542":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-122","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"源数据与缓存一致"},"3543":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-123","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"说明当前缓存结果可作为页面数据来源，仍需确认业务刷新时间"},"3544":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-124","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"数据一致性校验失败"},"3545":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-125","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"检查同步日志、增量字段、水位和源库是否仍在写入"},"3546":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-126","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"缓存同步失败"},"3547":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-127","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"先测试数据源连接，再检查 SQL、权限和任务超时"},"3548":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-128","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"看不到缓存入口"},"3549":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization-129","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/data-visualization#排查时不要忽略缓存","content":"确认数据源是否为 MySQL，环境是否已升级到当前文档版本"},"3550":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"page","content":"问题索引","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","常见问题"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq"},"3551":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"Crest 安装登录、权限、数据可视化、单点登录和 Kubernetes 常见问题索引。"},"3552":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"问题分类"},"3553":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#排查基本顺序","content":"排查基本顺序"},"3554":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"提交问题时建议提供"},"3555":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-4","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/faq#常用截图","content":"常用截图"},"3556":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-5","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"本页汇总 Crest 使用和运维中的高频问题。建议先按问题类型进入对应章节，再按“现象 → 可能原因 → 处理顺序”排查。"},"3557":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-6","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"排查问题时，不建议直接修改配置。应先复现问题、保留截图、记录发生时间，再查看审计日志、应用日志和浏览器提示。部分问题表现为“页面打不开”或“图表没数据”，实际原因可能在权限、数据源、缓存、代理或后台任务。"},"3558":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-7","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq","content":"多数问题可先从工作台判断影响范围。能登录但菜单少，通常是权限问题；工作台空白或资源统计异常，可能是接口、权限或元数据问题；只有某个资源异常，则优先检查该资源的上游数据和权限。"},"3559":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-8","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"服务无法访问、初始密码、登录失败、端口和 HTTPS 问题。"},"3560":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-9","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"菜单不可见、资源不可见、角色授权和账号生命周期问题。"},"3561":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-10","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"数据源、数据集、图表、仪表盘、大屏和导出问题。"},"3562":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-11","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#问题分类","content":"单点登录、回调地址、Ingress、Pod 状态和集群部署问题。"},"3563":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-12","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#排查基本顺序","content":"这个顺序适合大多数问题。先确认现象和影响范围，是为了避免把单个用户的权限问题误判成系统故障；先记录时间，是为了在审计日志和应用日志中快速定位；最后用普通账号验证，是为了避免管理员账号验证通过但业务用户仍然不可用。"},"3564":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-13","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"信息"},"3565":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-14","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"示例"},"3566":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-15","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"环境"},"3567":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-16","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"单机、离线、Kubernetes、外部 MySQL"},"3568":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-17","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"版本"},"3569":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-18","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"Crest 版本号、部署时间"},"3570":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-19","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"用户"},"3571":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-20","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"发生问题的账号和角色"},"3572":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-21","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"页面"},"3573":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-22","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"具体菜单、资源名称、访问地址"},"3574":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq-23","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq#提交问题时建议提供","content":"时间"},"3575":