数据门户只展示当前账号可访问的已发布资源。后台管理员能看到资源，不代表普通用户一定能在门户中看到。"},"3767":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-37","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"排查顺序："},"3768":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-38","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"资源是否已经发布。"},"3769":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-39","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"当前账号是否被直接授权、组织授权或角色授权。"},"3770":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-40","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"当前账号是否登录到了正确环境。"},"3771":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-41","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"资源是否被移动、删除或取消发布。"},"3772":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-42","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"搜索关键字和资源类型筛选是否过窄。"},"3773":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-43","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"用普通测试账号复现，确认不是管理员视角误判。"},"3774":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-44","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#门户里看不到已发布资源","content":"角色管理页用于维护用户职责分类。建议把角色按职责设计，而不是按个人设计。例如数据管理员、内容编辑者、业务查看者、安全审计员。后续人员变动时，只需调整用户归属，不需要重做权限模型。"},"3775":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-45","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"这通常是功能权限或资源操作权限不足。处理方法："},"3776":{"id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions-46","page_id":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/faq/permissions#用户能看资源但不能编辑","content":"确认该用户是否具备资源编辑