de/dashboard-164","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#添加查询组件-1","content":"点击顶部“查询组件”，选择日期、下拉、文本搜索、数字区间等组件，放到页面顶部或筛选区。"},"4882":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-165","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#绑定目标图表","content":"选中查询组件，在右侧配置要影响哪些图表。一个筛选器可以影响一个或多个图表。"},"4883":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-166","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#选择筛选字段","content":"给每个目标图表选择对应字段。不同数据集之间字段名称可能不同，要确认业务含义一致。"},"4884":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-167","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置展示方式","content":"日期字段使用日期或日期范围；区域、部门、产品使用下拉或搜索；金额、时长使用数字区间。"},"4885":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-168","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#设置默认值","content":"常见默认值包括本月、最近 30 天、全部区域、当前用户所属组织。"},"4886":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-169","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"保存后进入预览，切换筛选条件，确认所有目标图表同步变化。"},"4887":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-170","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"查询组件配置要点："},"4888":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-171","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"配置项"},"4889":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-172","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard#预览验证","content":"说明"},"4890":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard-173","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboard","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dashboa