全量校准，例如每 24 小时做一次全量刷新，用来修正遗漏、补录和水位异常。"},"5464":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-326","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#设置超时时间","content":"根据数据量设置合理超时。任务经常超时，通常说明数据范围太大、SQL 太慢或源库连接不稳定。"},"5465":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-327","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#开启更新后校验","content":"勾选“更新后校验”。任务完成后对比源端和缓存端的行数或水位，便于发现缓存异常。"},"5466":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-328","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#执行一次并查看状态","content":"点击“立即更新”，确认行数、执行时间、缓存状态和校验结果正常。"},"5467":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-329","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时更新用于把数据集刷新节奏固定下来。它不等同于“越频繁越好”，刷新频率要和源数据产生频率、业务使用时间和系统承载能力匹配。"},"5468":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-330","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"数据类型"},"5469":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-331","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"示例频率"},"5470":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-332","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"说明"},"5471":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-333","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"经营日报、月报"},"5472":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-334","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"每天 1 次"},"5473":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-335","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"通常安