r-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"示例：项目周会每天上午 9 点查看交付大屏，可以把缓存定时设置在每天 8:30，前提是上游数仓在 8:00 前完成更新。如果上游 9:30 才更新，Crest 8:30 只能同步到旧数据，页面可展示但指标口径不准确。"},"5485":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-347","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时配置建议写进数据集说明："},"5486":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-348","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"信息"},"5487":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-349","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"示例"},"5488":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-350","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"刷新方式"},"5489":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-351","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"增量更新"},"5490":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-352","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"增量字段"},"5491":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-353","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"更新时间"},"5492":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-354","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"定时频率"},"5493":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-355","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"每天 08:30"},"5494":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset-356","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/dataset#定时更新","content":"