ser-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#收藏和最近使用","content":"资源被删除、取消发布或回收权限后，收藏和最近使用中的入口可能失效。遇到这种情况，应先在全部资源中搜索名称；仍找不到时，联系管理员检查资源状态和授权范围。"},"6390":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-55","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"资源较多时，建议先使用关键字搜索，再配合资源类型筛选。"},"6391":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-56","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"查找目标"},"6392":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-57","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"建议操作"},"6393":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-58","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"知道资源名称"},"6394":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-59","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"直接输入名称关键字"},"6395":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"只看大屏"},"6396":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"类型选择“数据大屏”"},"6397":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"只看分析页面"},"6398":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-63","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"类型选择“仪表盘”"},"6399":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal-64","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/portal#搜索和筛选","content":"最近看过但忘记名称"},"6400":{"id":"