est/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#保存一次","content":"空白画布设置好后先保存。后续预览、发布、外部参数和跳转都依赖已保存的大屏资源。"},"6591":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-147","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#保存一次","content":"右侧配置区中的“尺寸、基础配置、背景、配色”是创建大屏的基础。常见问题是组件完成后才发现画布比例不合适。比例一旦改动，组件位置和字号通常都要重新调整。"},"6592":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-148","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"高质量大屏依赖稳定的页面结构，而不是单个组件的视觉效果。建议先按区域放置组件，再逐个绑定数据。"},"6593":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-149","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"标题、说明、更新时间和指标口径通常用文本组件完成。创建骨架时，可以先添加一个富文本作为标题，再复制几个文本组件作为区块标题。这样页面结构会先稳定下来，后续添加图表时更容易保持层级一致。"},"6594":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-150","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"一个常见的示例结构："},"6595":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-151","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"区域"},"6596":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-152","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"内容"},"6597":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-153","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"创建方式"},"6598":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-154","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"标题区"},"6599":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-155","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第一步搭页面骨架","content":"大屏标题、业务说明、更新时间"},"6600":{"id":"/docs/crest/us