:"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"大屏组件的配置逻辑和仪表盘一致：选数据集，拖维度和指标，检查预览结果，再调整样式。"},"6643":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-199","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"如果还没有可用数据集，先回到“数据集”章节准备模型。大屏不适合直接处理未清洗数据，应使用已经整理好的数据集：字段名称清楚、日期类型正确、指标口径明确、缓存或直连方式已经验证。"},"6644":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-200","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"操作顺序："},"6645":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-201","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"选中画布上的图表组件。"},"6646":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-202","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"在右侧切到数据配置。"},"6647":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-203","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"选择数据集。"},"6648":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-204","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"把维度拖到分类、时间轴、系列或行列位置。"},"6649":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-205","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"把指标拖到数值位置。"},"6650":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-206","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"点击刷新或更新图表。"},"6651":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-207","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#第三步绑定数据","content":"检查数值是否和数据集预览一致。"},"6652":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-208","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","t