crest/user-guide/screen#部署需求累积流图","content":"创建步骤："},"6704":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-260","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备数据集","content":"数据集至少要有日期、阶段、需求数三个字段。日期是一行快照的统计日期，阶段是需求当时所在阶段，需求数是该日期该阶段的数量。"},"6705":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-261","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#添加累积流图","content":"在大屏编辑器点击“图表”，选择累积流图。把组件放到页面主图区，宽度建议占页面一半以上，高度保持足够展示空间。"},"6706":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-262","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#绑定字段","content":"选择数据集后，把“日期”放入 X 轴，把“需求数”放入 Y 轴，把“需求阶段”放入系列或堆叠字段。"},"6707":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-263","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置排序","content":"阶段顺序建议按业务流转顺序排列，例如需求池、分析澄清、就绪待开发、开发中、代码评审、测试验证、待发布。"},"6708":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-264","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"打开平滑曲线和面积填充，保留图例。颜色按阶段固定，避免每次刷新后变化。X 轴日期可以按天或周展示，标签过密时减少显示。"},"6709":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-265","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"使用提醒：累积流图依赖“每日阶段快照”。如果只有当前状态，没有历史快照，就无法还原阶段变化，只能做当前阶段分布。"},"6710":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-266","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"可以按以下样例准备数据。字段名不必完全一样，但含义要对应："},"6711":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-267","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"统计日期"},"6712":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-268","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式","content":"需求阶段"},"6713":{"id":"/docs/crest/user