301","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#设置颜色","content":"阶段颜色建议和累积流图一致。用户看到同一种颜色时，能自然联想到同一个阶段。"},"6746":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-302","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"标签要显示阶段名和关键数值。示例中的写法是“数、均、P90、超”，信息密度高，但仍能读懂。"},"6747":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-303","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"使用提醒：漏斗的重点不是视觉宽度，而是清晰呈现阶段差异。阶段太多时，优先保留主流程阶段，把过细状态归并。"},"6748":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-304","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"阶段周期漏斗的字段可以从需求流转记录中计算出来。示例结构如下："},"6749":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-305","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"阶段"},"6750":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-306","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"需求数"},"6751":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-307","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"平均耗时"},"6752":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-308","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"P90 耗时"},"6753":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-309","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"超期数"},"6754":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-310","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整标签","content":"需求澄清"},"6755":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-311","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/use