接复制颜色。先按以下顺序拆解："},"6933":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-489","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#使用内置示例","content":"这张大屏解决什么业务问题。"},"6934":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-490","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#使用内置示例","content":"顶部指标卡回答什么问题。"},"6935":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-491","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#使用内置示例","content":"主图区用什么图说明趋势、瓶颈或结构。"},"6936":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-492","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#使用内置示例","content":"明细表帮助用户追到哪些记录。"},"6937":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-493","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#使用内置示例","content":"哪些字段可以替换成自己的字段。"},"6938":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-494","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#使用内置示例","content":"示例不是强制模板。它们提供的是一种组织方式：先总览，再分析，再下钻，再说明口径。"},"6939":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-495","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"这是经营类示例。它的价值不在于固定使用零售字段，而是展示“指标总览 + 趋势 + 排行 + 转化 + 明细”的组织方式。换成制造、教育、医疗或项目管理场景时，可以保留结构，替换字段。"},"6940":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-496","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"这个大屏适合学习经营类驾驶舱的布局。顶部用一句话说明业务范围，中间用指标卡展示销售、订单、会员、客单价、毛利率和履约率，下面用趋势、排行、漏斗、结构和明细覆盖经营闭环。"},"6941":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-497","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"学习重点："},"6942":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-498","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"第一行指标卡负责回答“现在整体怎么样”。"},"6943":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-499","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"趋势图回答“最近有没有变化”。"},"6944":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-500","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"门店排行和商品排行回答“谁贡献最大”。"},"6945":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-501","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"漏斗和履约率回答“转化和交付有没有问题”。"},"6946":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-502","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"明细和预警回答“需要追到哪一项处理”。"},"6947":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-503","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"如果要改成自己的经营大屏，可按这个顺序替换："},"6948":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-504","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"把标题改成自己的业务主题。"},"6949":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-505","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"用自己的销售额、订单数、会员数替换指标卡。"},"6950":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-506","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"用门店、区域、产品、渠道字段替换排行图。"},"6951":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-507","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"保留“趋势 + 排行 + 结构 + 预警”的布局。"},"6952":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-508","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"最后替换颜色、Logo 和口径说明。"},"6953":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-509","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#连锁零售经营驾驶舱","content":"复刻这张示例时，可按以下顺序做："},"6954":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-510","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备经营数据集","content":"至少准备日期、区域、门店、商品、渠道、销售额、订单数、会员数、毛利率、履约状态等字段。经营大屏建议使用已经汇总好的日级或月级数据集。"},"6955":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-511","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#搭顶部指标区","content":"放 4 到 6 个指标卡，例如销售额、订单数、客单价、毛利率、会员数、履约率。指标卡先统一样式，再替换字段。"},"6956":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-512","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做主趋势图","content":"用日期做 X 轴，销售额和订单数做指标。趋势图放在中间偏左的位置，让用户先看到业务是否增长。"},"6957":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-513","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做排行和结构图","content":"门店排行用条形图，渠道结构用环形图或堆叠图。排行限制 Top 10，结构分类不要超过 6 个。"},"6958":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-514","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"底部放门店或商品明细，右侧放履约异常、库存风险或目标达成预警。明细表只保留需要定位问题的字段。"},"6959":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-515","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"字段替换示例："},"6960":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-516","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"示例字段"},"6961":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-517","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"可以替换成"},"6962":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-518","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"销售额"},"6963":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-519","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"项目收入、订单金额、服务收入"},"6964":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-520","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"订单数"},"6965":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-521","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"需求数、工单数、线索数"},"6966":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-522","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"门店"},"6967":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-523","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"项目、客户、区域、团队"},"6968":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-524","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"商品"},"6969":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-525","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"产品线、服务类型、需求类型"},"6970":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-526","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"履约率"},"6971":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-527","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补明细和预警","content":"完成率、交付率、SLA 达成率"},"6972":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-528","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"这是管理层总览示例。它把多个主题放在一屏，但仍然有清晰顺序：核心指标在前，需求流动、人力、交付、成本和风险依次展开。复用时不宜继续增加主题，应优先保持页面可读。"},"6973":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-529","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"这个大屏适合学习研发管理总览。它把吞吐量、人力容量、DORA 交付、预算执行和风险下钻放在一个页面里，适合管理层快速判断研发组织是否健康。"},"6974":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-530","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"阅读顺序："},"6975":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-531","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"查看顶部指标卡：交付需求、活跃需求、容量匹配度、投入工时、代码净行数、供应商 SLA。"},"6976":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-532","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"再看累积流图：需求是否在某个阶段堆积。"},"6977":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-533","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"看吞吐量和容量对比：交付速度是否匹配人力投入。"},"6978":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-534","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"看 DORA 和预算：交付效率和成本是否异常。"},"6979":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-535","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"最后看项目明细：定位具体项目。"},"6980":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-536","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"复用建议："},"6981":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-537","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"适合做“公司级研发总览”。"},"6982":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-538","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"指标卡数量不要再增加，过多会削弱重点。"},"6983":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-539","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"下方明细表保留，用于从总览追到项目。"},"6984":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-540","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#研发经营总览大屏","content":"复刻这张示例时，可按以下顺序："},"6985":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-541","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备研发总览数据","content":"至少准备组织、项目、日期、需求数、活跃需求数、投入工时、人力容量、交付需求数、预算执行、风险等级等字段。"},"6986":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-542","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先做管理层指标卡","content":"顶部指标卡只放管理层最关心的结果，例如交付需求、活跃需求、容量匹配度、投入工时、预算执行率、风险项目数。"},"6987":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-543","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置需求流动主图","content":"使用累积流图或阶段堆叠图展示需求堆积。这个图负责解释需求是否卡在某个阶段。"},"6988":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-544","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置投入和产出对比","content":"用柱状图、折线图或矩阵图展示人力投入和交付产出。投入和产出的统计周期必须一致。"},"6989":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-545","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置风险明细","content":"底部保留项目明细表，字段包含项目、负责人、风险等级、超期需求数、预算偏差。管理层看到异常后能继续追踪。"},"6990":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-546","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#配置风险明细","content":"复刻时不宜把研发活动指标全部放入同一屏。管理层总览的重点是“交付结果、投入产出、风险”，代码提交、缺陷、工时等细节可以放到二级大屏。"},"6991":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-547","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"这是流程效率示例，适合学习“从总量到瓶颈再到明细”的设计方法：累积流看堆积，漏斗看阶段，P90 看长尾，明细表定位具体需求。"},"6992":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-548","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"这个大屏围绕需求生命周期设计，适合跟踪需求从进入需求池到发布上线的流动效率。"},"6993":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-549","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"学习重点："},"6994":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-550","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"累积流图看阶段堆积。"},"6995":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-551","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"漏斗看每个阶段数量。"},"6996":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-552","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"P90 时效用于定位耗时瓶颈。"},"6997":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-553","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"吞吐趋势看交付节奏。"},"6998":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-554","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"明细表用于定位具体需求。"},"6999":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-555","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"创建同类大屏时，数据集至少要有：需求编号、阶段、进入阶段时间、离开阶段时间、负责人、项目、优先级、状态。没有阶段时间，难以做出时效分析。"},"7000":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-556","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#需求流动与交付效率大屏","content":"复刻这张示例时，可按以下顺序："},"7001":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-557","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#先做顶部指标卡","content":"准备交付需求数、活跃需求数、平均周期、超期需求数四个指标。先保证这些数字能和数据集预览对上。"},"7002":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-558","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#再做累积流图","content":"使用阶段快照数据集，按日期和阶段统计需求数。它是这张大屏的主图，应保留足够展示面积。"},"7003":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-559","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#补阶段周期漏斗","content":"使用阶段统计数据集，展示每个阶段的需求数、平均耗时、P90 和超期数。颜色要和累积流图保持一致。"},"7004":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-560","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#加趋势和-p90","content":"用月度吞吐趋势看交付节奏，用 P90 条形图看长尾阶段。两个图用于解释主图中的瓶颈。"},"7005":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-561","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#最后放明细表","content":"表格保留需求编号、项目、阶段、负责人、在库天数和优先级。用户发现异常后，可以从这里定位具体需求。"},"7006":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-562","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#最后放明细表","content":"如果没有完整的阶段快照，可以先做简化版：顶部指标卡 + 当前阶段分布 + 阶段耗时排行 + 明细表。等数据补齐后，再升级成累积流图。"},"7007":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-563","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"这是资源经营示例。它适合用在人力、供应商、预算、产能这类主题。复用时要特别注意单位统一：人数、人天、工时和金额不能混在一个指标里解释。"},"7008":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-564","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"这个大屏适合学习资源管理类页面。它把人力投入、角色分布、供应商 SLA、预算执行和人员明细放在一起，用于判断资源是否够、成本是否合理、供应商是否稳定。"},"7009":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-565","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"复用时注意："},"7010":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-566","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"容量类指标要明确单位，是人天、工时还是人数。"},"7011":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-567","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"供应商指标要写清统计周期。"},"7012":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-568","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"预算图要明确是预算执行率、预算余额还是实际成本。"},"7013":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-569","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"人员明细通常包含敏感信息，对外展示前要脱敏。"},"7014":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-570","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#人力容量与供应商经营大屏","content":"复刻这张示例时，可按以下顺序："},"7015":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-571","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备资源数据集","content":"至少准备月份、组织、角色、人员、投入人天、计划容量、实际工时、供应商、SLA 达成率、预算金额、实际成本等字段。"},"7016":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-572","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做容量指标卡","content":"顶部放总人力、可用容量、投入人天、容量利用率、预算执行率。每个指标都要写清单位。"},"7017":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-573","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做角色和供应商结构","content":"角色分布可以用环形图或堆叠条形图，供应商 SLA 可以用排行图。颜色只用于区分状态，不要让每个供应商随机变色。"},"7018":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-574","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做投入产出矩阵","content":"用投入人天做 X 轴，交付需求或完成工时做 Y 轴，气泡大小用成本或工时。它适合判断资源是否投入到有效产出上。"},"7019":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-575","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做人员明细","content":"底部表格保留人员、角色、项目、投入人天、工时、状态。对外演示时隐藏个人姓名或改成团队维度。"},"7020":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-576","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做人员明细","content":"字段替换时要统一单位：人数、人天、小时、金额不能混在一个图里直接比较。确实需要比较时，用两个指标或双轴，并在标题里写清楚。"},"7021":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-577","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"这是工程效能示例，适合学习如何把活动量、交付结果和质量结果放在一起看。复用时不应只做代码行数排行，应结合需求、发布和缺陷指标一起判断。"},"7022":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-578","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"这个大屏适合学习工程效能类页面。它把工时、代码变更、DORA 趋势和明细追踪放在一起，关注研发活动是否转化为有效交付。"},"7023":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-579","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"使用建议："},"7024":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-580","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"不应只看代码行数，必须结合需求、工时和发布结果。"},"7025":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-581","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"DORA 指标适合看趋势，不适合孤立比较单日数值。"},"7026":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-582","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"工时分类要有清晰口径，避免把会议、支持和返工混在一起。"},"7027":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-583","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"明细表保留项目、负责人和周期，便于复盘。"},"7028":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-584","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#工程活动与代码效能大屏","content":"复刻这张示例时，可按以下顺序："},"7029":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-585","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备工程活动数据","content":"至少准备日期、项目、仓库、负责人、提交次数、代码变更行数、合并请求数、构建次数、发布次数、变更失败数、恢复时间等字段。"},"7030":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-586","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做活动量指标","content":"顶部指标卡展示提交次数、合并请求数、发布次数、构建成功率。指标标题要说明统计周期，例如“近 7 天发布次数”。"},"7031":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-587","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做-dora-趋势","content":"用日期做 X 轴，展示部署频率、变更前置时间、变更失败率、平均恢复时间。不同量纲建议拆成多张图或使用清晰单位。"},"7032":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-588","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做项目排行","content":"用条形图展示项目活跃度、构建失败次数或变更失败数。排行用于定位问题，不应将其直接作为个人评价依据。"},"7033":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-589","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做明细追踪","content":"底部表格保留项目、仓库、负责人、最近发布、失败原因和处理状态，方便复盘。"},"7034":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-590","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做明细追踪","content":"工程效能类大屏容易被误用。建议在页面说明里写清楚：代码行数和提交次数只代表活动量，不直接等于价值；价值判断要结合需求交付、质量和业务结果。"},"7035":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-591","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"这是风险预警示例，适合学习如何用颜色和层级突出异常。复用时要先定义风险等级，再配置颜色和阈值；红色不应仅作为装饰色使用。"},"7036":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-592","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"这个大屏适合学习风险预警页面。它关注缺陷密度、生产问题、变更失败、恢复时间和项目风险清单，适合质量例会和发布风险评审。"},"7037":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-593","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"复用建议："},"7038":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-594","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"顶部放核心风险指标，用户先判断风险等级。"},"7039":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-595","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"中间用矩阵或趋势图展示风险变化。"},"7040":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-596","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"底部保留风险清单，方便责任人跟进。"},"7041":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-597","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"风险颜色要固定，例如红色代表高风险，黄色代表关注。"},"7042":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-598","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"对外展示时避免暴露客户名称、事故细节和人员信息。"},"7043":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-599","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#质量稳定性与风险预警大屏","content":"复刻这张示例时，可按以下顺序："},"7044":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-600","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#准备质量风险数据","content":"至少准备日期、项目、缺陷数、严重缺陷数、生产问题数、变更失败次数、恢复时长、风险等级、责任人和处理状态。"},"7045":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-601","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做风险指标卡","content":"顶部放生产问题数、严重缺陷数、变更失败率、平均恢复时间、高风险项目数。风险指标必须有明确统计周期。"},"7046":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-602","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做风险趋势","content":"用折线图展示近 30 天缺陷、生产问题或变更失败变化。趋势比单日值更适合判断风险是否扩大。"},"7047":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-603","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做风险矩阵","content":"横轴可以用影响范围，纵轴用发生概率或恢复时长，颜色用风险等级。红黄绿含义要固定。"},"7048":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-604","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做风险清单","content":"底部表格保留项目、风险等级、问题描述、责任人、截止时间、处理状态。对外展示前删除敏感事故细节。"},"7049":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-605","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#做风险清单","content":"风险类页面不应追求“颜色越多越突出”。颜色是告警语言：红色必须代表需要处理，黄色代表关注，绿色代表正常。规则一旦确定，就不应在不同图表里随意改变。"},"7050":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-606","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#如何把示例改成自己的大屏","content":"效率较高的做法不是从空白画布开始，而是复制一个结构相近的示例，再逐步替换。"},"7051":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-607","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#复制示例","content":"在数据大屏列表中找到示例大屏，复制到自己的文件夹。复制后立即改名，例如“华东区域经营驾驶舱”。"},"7052":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-608","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#保留布局","content":"第一轮只替换标题和数据，不改布局。确认数据都能显示后，再调整视觉。"},"7053":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-609","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#替换数据集","content":"逐个选中组件，把数据集换成自己的业务数据集。字段含义要对应，例如销售额换销售额，区域换区域，不能只看字段名相似。"},"7054":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-610","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#替换字段","content":"指标卡先换指标，趋势图换日期和指标，排行图换分类和指标，明细表换业务字段。"},"7055":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-611","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#检查数值","content":"每替换一个区域，就和数据集预览或业务样例核对。不要等全部替换完再发现口径不一致。"},"7056":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-612","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#调整样式-1","content":"最后统一颜色、字号、标题、单位和说明。避免每个组件形成不同风格。"},"7057":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-613","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"用目标屏幕预览，确认无异常后发布。正式页建议保留一份“编辑副本”，避免直接改线上页面。"},"7058":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-614","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"替换时常见出错点是字段口径。比如示例里的“销售额”可能是近 180 天含税销售额，实际数据集可能是本月不含税销售额。标题、单位和说明必须一起改。"},"7059":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-615","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"替换顺序建议固定为“标题 → 数据集 → 字段 → 单位 → 颜色 → 说明”。不能只改标题和颜色，否则页面视觉上已经调整，数据却仍然是示例口径。"},"7060":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-616","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"替换完成后做一次对照检查："},"7061":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-617","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"检查项"},"7062":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-618","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"怎么确认"},"7063":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-619","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"标题"},"7064":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-620","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"是否已经改成自己的业务主题"},"7065":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-621","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"数据集"},"7066":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-622","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","content":"每个组件是否都换成自己的数据集"},"7067":{"id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen-623","page_id":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/user-guide/screen#预览发布","cont