e-font-60","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"导出文件是否能正确显示字体。"},"8339":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-61","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"交付验收建议保留截图：登录页、工作台、一个仪表盘预览、一个大屏预览、一个导出文件。这样后续客户或业务方反馈品牌展示问题时，可以快速对比变更前后效果。"},"8340":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font-62","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/system-site-font#交付前检查","content":"建议把站点配置变更写入交付清单，至少包含修改人、修改时间、旧值、新值和验收截图。这样后续升级、迁移或重装时，可以快速恢复一致的品牌展示。"},"8341":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"page","content":"用户与组织","breadcrumbs":["技术文档","Crest","管理员指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs"},"8342":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-0","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","content":"Crest 用户管理、组织管理、账号生命周期和账号安全操作说明。"},"8343":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-1","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#用户管理对象","content":"用户管理对象"},"8344":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-2","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#创建用户","content":"创建用户"},"8345":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-3","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#进入用户管理","content":"进入用户管理"},"8346":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-4","page_id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs#新建用户","content":"新建用户"},"8347":{"id":"/docs/crest/admin-guide/users-orgs-5","page_id":"/doc